{"id":"33004fe25aa3cf22","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/784_Belnap_FOUR.md","title":"784 Belnap FOUR","display":"784_Belnap_FOUR","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"784-Belnap-FOUR\">784 Belnap FOUR</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and}_t,\\operatorname{or}_t,\n\\operatorname{and}_k,\\operatorname{or}_k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and}_t,\\operatorname{or}_t,\n\\operatorname{and}_k,\\operatorname{or}_k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}_t,\\operatorname{or}_t,\n\\operatorname{and}_k,\\operatorname{or}_k:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and}_t,\\operatorname{or}_t,\n\\operatorname{and}_k,\\operatorname{or}_k:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\neg A,A\\wedge_tB,A\\vee_tB,A\\wedge_kB,A\\vee_kB\">\\(p,\\neg A,A\\wedge_tB,A\\vee_tB,A\\wedge_kB,A\\vee_kB\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}_t(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}_t(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}_t(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}_t(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}_k(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}_k(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}_k(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}_k(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>自由变元函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{and}_t(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{and}_t(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{or}_t(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{or}_t(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{and}_k(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{and}_k(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{or}_k(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(\\operatorname{or}_k(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{FOUR}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{FOUR}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\}\\)</span>，并定义替换扩张算子</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ext}_{FOUR}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{FOUR}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ext}_{FOUR}:\\mathsf{Subst}_{FOUR}\\to\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}^{\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{FOUR}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:=\\operatorname{Ext}_{FOUR}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 为唯一满足下列递归子句的映射：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}_t(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}_t(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}_t(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}_t(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}_t(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}_t(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}_t(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}_t(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}_k(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}_k(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}_k(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}_k(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}_k(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}_k(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}_k(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}_k(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子；相应函数与关系的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{FOUR}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,FOUR}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{FOUR}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}),\n\\qquad\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,FOUR}\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{FOUR}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,FOUR}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{FOUR}(A)=\\varnothing,\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,FOUR}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-双格四值矩阵\">4. 双格四值矩阵</h1>\n<p>值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{FOUR}=\\{0,1\\}\\times\\{0,1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{FOUR}=\\{0,1\\}\\times\\{0,1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>指定值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf D_{FOUR}=\\{(1,0),(1,1)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf D_{FOUR}=\\{(1,0),(1,1)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>真序与知识序的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\le_t,\\le_k\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf V_{FOUR}\\times\\mathsf V_{FOUR}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\le_t,\\le_k\\ \\subseteq\\ \\mathsf V_{FOUR}\\times\\mathsf V_{FOUR}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=(t,f)\">\\(a=(t,f)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(u,g)\">\\(b=(u,g)\\)</span>，定义真序与知识序：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le_t b\\Longleftrightarrow t\\le u\\text{ 且 }g\\le f,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le_t b\\Longleftrightarrow t\\le u\\text{ 且 }g\\le f,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\le_k b\\Longleftrightarrow t\\le u\\text{ 且 }f\\le g.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\le_k b\\Longleftrightarrow t\\le u\\text{ 且 }f\\le g.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义运算的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{FOUR}:\\mathsf V_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf V_{FOUR},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{FOUR}:\\mathsf V_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf V_{FOUR},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_t,\\vee_t,\\wedge_k,\\vee_k:\n\\mathsf V_{FOUR}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{FOUR}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge_t,\\vee_t,\\wedge_k,\\vee_k:\n\\mathsf V_{FOUR}^2\\to\\mathsf V_{FOUR}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐点定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{FOUR}(t,f)=(f,t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{FOUR}(t,f)=(f,t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(t,f)\\wedge_t(u,g)=(\\min(t,u),\\max(f,g)),\n\\qquad\n(t,f)\\vee_t(u,g)=(\\max(t,u),\\min(f,g)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(t,f)\\wedge_t(u,g)=(\\min(t,u),\\max(f,g)),\n\\qquad\n(t,f)\\vee_t(u,g)=(\\max(t,u),\\min(f,g)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(t,f)\\wedge_k(u,g)=(\\min(t,u),\\min(f,g)),\n\\qquad\n(t,f)\\vee_k(u,g)=(\\max(t,u),\\max(f,g)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(t,f)\\wedge_k(u,g)=(\\min(t,u),\\min(f,g)),\n\\qquad\n(t,f)\\vee_k(u,g)=(\\max(t,u),\\max(f,g)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书\">5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{FOUR}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf V_{FOUR}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{FOUR}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf V_{FOUR}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{FOUR}\">\\(v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{FOUR}\\)</span> 的扩张具有类型</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf V_{FOUR},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf V_{FOUR},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并由下列子句定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{FOUR}\\overline v(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{FOUR}\\overline v(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}_t(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_t\\overline v(B),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}_t(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_t\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}_t(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_t\\overline v(B),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}_t(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_t\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}_k(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_k\\overline v(B),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}_k(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_k\\overline v(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}_k(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_k\\overline v(B),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}_k(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_k\\overline v(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>反例证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{FOUR}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{FOUR}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{FOUR}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{FOUR})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{FOUR}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{FOUR}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{FOUR})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{FOUR}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-语义后承\">6. 语义后承</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{FOUR}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{FOUR}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{FOUR}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{FOUR}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{FOUR}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{FOUR}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{FOUR}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{FOUR}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{FOUR}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{FOUR}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除\">7. 语义证书与证明对象排除</h1>\n<p>语义证书函数的类型为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FOUR}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FOUR}:\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\{\\star\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}\\)</span>，定义可核验证书对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\{\\star\\},&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing,\\\\\n\\varnothing,&amp;\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{FOUR}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{FOUR}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FOUR}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显式性约束：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\mathsf{Valid}_{FOUR}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_{FOUR}\">\\(\\Vdash_{FOUR}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FOUR}\\)</span> 均由本文件的真值集合、指定值集合、赋值扩张和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR}\\)</span> 定义；不引用外部代数类、公式类或命名基逻辑。</p>\n<p>形式证明规则关系的类型及取值声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FOUR}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FOUR}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FOUR}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FOUR}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本条目是 Belnap 双格四值语义后承系统；因此不定义非空 Hilbert 公理集合、证明序列或由规则生成的可证关系。</p>\n<h1 id=\"8.-整个语义形式系统\">8. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{FOUR}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR},\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR},\\operatorname{BV}_{FOUR},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{FOUR},\\operatorname{Ext}_{FOUR},\\equiv_{\\alpha,FOUR},\n\\mathsf V_{FOUR},\\mathsf D_{FOUR},\\le_t,\\le_k,\n\\neg_{FOUR},\\wedge_t,\\vee_t,\\wedge_k,\\vee_k,\n\\mathsf{Val}_{FOUR},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FOUR},\n\\Vdash_{FOUR},\\mathsf{Valid}_{FOUR},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{FOUR},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FOUR}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{FOUR}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR},\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{FOUR},\\operatorname{BV}_{FOUR},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{FOUR},\\operatorname{Ext}_{FOUR},\\equiv_{\\alpha,FOUR},\n\\mathsf V_{FOUR},\\mathsf D_{FOUR},\\le_t,\\le_k,\n\\neg_{FOUR},\\wedge_t,\\vee_t,\\wedge_k,\\vee_k,\n\\mathsf{Val}_{FOUR},\\overline{(\\cdot)},\\mathsf{Fail}_{FOUR},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{FOUR},\n\\Vdash_{FOUR},\\mathsf{Valid}_{FOUR},\\mathsf{SubRule}_{FOUR},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{FOUR}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是对象语言同时含真序格运算与知识序格运算；该条目只定义语义后承、反例证书和代换保持关系，不等同于只含真序联结词的 FDE。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"784-Belnap-FOUR","text":"784 Belnap FOUR","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-双格四值矩阵","text":"4. 双格四值矩阵","level":1},{"id":"5.-赋值、公式值与反例证书","text":"5. 赋值、公式值与反例证书","level":1},{"id":"6.-语义后承","text":"6. 语义后承","level":1},{"id":"7.-语义证书与证明对象排除","text":"7. 语义证书与证明对象排除","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个语义形式系统","text":"8. 整个语义形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\n\\operatorname{and}_t,\\operatorname{or}_t,\n\\operatorname{and}_k,\\operatorname{or}_k.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{FOUR}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{FOUR}